### GET request to example server
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Meeting Room A",
  "description": "Ground floor meeting room",
  "location": "Floor 1",
  "type": "ROOM"
}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resources?page=0&size=101

### PUT request
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/resources/83d81226-3df9-40cd-aee6-80542c66c1c2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Changed Room A",
  "description": "Moved to top floor",
  "location": "Floor 9",
  "type": "ROOM"
}